## Pending

- `editor/AVEditorEngine.wasm` (the in-browser editor's render engine,
  shipped gzipped in the preset pack): an Opus-owned prebuilt binary. Whether
  it can be distributed with this release is not yet decided. It statically
  links third-party libraries (among them FFmpeg, GLib, Pango, cairo,
  SoundTouch and FreeImage) whose licence notices would have to ship with it.

